OL,3,GNEWSAFighting blind: Paralympian takes
OL,4,Aon MMA challenge
OL,5,
OL,6,FChris Telesford was just one month old
OL,7,Fwhen he was diagnosed with an eye
OL,8,Fcondition so rare that ocular
OL,9,Fspecialists around the world have
OL,10,Fstudied his eyes ever since.
OL,12,FHe has bilateral coloboma of the optic
OL,13,Fnerve with nystagmus and has been
OL,14,Ftreated at Moorfields Eye Hospital all
OL,15,Fhis life.
OL,17,F"It means I've got both short- and
OL,18,Flong-sightedness in both eyes at the
OL,19,Fsame time. One pupil is misshapen and
OL,20,Fthe cataract made everything blurry and
OL,21,Fdistorted," he said.
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,325,320,200,140,0,100
